### Get all expenses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses


### Get expense by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/6


### Create valid expense
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Groceries",
  "amount": 850.00
}


### Create invalid expense
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "amount": -100
}


### Update existing expense
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated Petrol",
  "amount": 1600.00
}


### Update missing expense
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated Petrol",
  "amount": 1600.00
}


### Update with invalid body
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "amount": -100
}


### Delete existing expense
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/10


### Delete missing expense
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/9999